      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.528,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.472
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "故事要从2022年10月的京都说起。",
      "sha256": "a14aa59530cd39699979f0f2abcd680349161d9889834ab9f49b04b9cc3fee5c",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.296,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.704
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "21岁的浜野日菜子，立命馆大学三年级学生。",
      "sha256": "00ec5ea7c423978375a1f978f5ce13f9af257a0dba519f02721a85d5c2f39847",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.736,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.264
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "十月夜晚，浜野与宫本一希吃了一顿饭。",
      "sha256": "2cc83388f750897e10ff216f6bdf29198f7826fa45bc0a4d44a096a0bd1b4b9a",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.704,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.296
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "饭后，两人回到浜野的公寓。",
      "sha256": "dd784f98604e451c8f3ab2de76010957bff763a041b9afe7ac6055f1e60a7127",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.168,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.832
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "据报道，那天夜里，浜野突然身体不适。",
      "sha256": "43b570946ea8196cb8289ac065a6a504958f8ee6ca48552f99ebd3621ed4a730",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.128,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.872
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "据报道，宫本没有叫救护车，而是联系了浜野的父母。",
      "sha256": "478807853b04e01da514471e0061d65fec3881cc8219ef147fbba44b1d1972d7",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.136,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.864
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "三天后，浜野在医院去世。",
      "sha256": "74341571290f79cc99f1398d11040652cc9f7cba3bd046493e9518a50c31e6ee",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.288,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.712
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "那一刻，病房里只剩下监护仪的声音。",
      "sha256": "df37ad748577db06c16b67d0d5f7c9f8324a56218651619cb4a067328756ae10",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.064,
      "atempo": 1.0128,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "据报道，转折来自死后的一次检验：样本中检出了铊。",
      "sha256": "b909d841fca5afb834a9eb6a1ebaed353590885e0e27fb634b5c1ddacc23e694",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.784,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.216
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "铊这种金属剧毒，历史上曾被用来灭鼠。",
      "sha256": "c3b68bc648e9261eff395281d496d4d6ba9e78fd7a1553bbf602118d33ae7ba9",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.704,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 2.296
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "所以，中毒的线索，常常藏在普通的病情里。",
      "sha256": "66fe11b828d939bc54ad2938c215f76aa9fe27b7971b4327b6cf32ed6b7614bb",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
